# Fetched from the Actions API by fetch.py (about 33 MB). The committed
# evidence.json and logs/ carry every counter the published numbers use, so the
# report reproduces without committing the raw payloads.
data/runs.json
data/runs_p*.json
data/workflow_runs.json
data/jobs.json
data/workflows.json

# The parsed sccache outputs behind every published number are small and are
# the only evidence that survives if the Actions logs expire. Re-include them.
!data/logs/*.log
